# Database rules (summary; full text in `DATABASE.md`)

- All schema changes via a migration file. Never edit the live DB.
- Migration naming: `<<MIGRATION_NAMING>>`.
- Every user-data table protected by <<AUTHZ_STRATEGY>>.
- Every table has `created_at` / `updated_at` (or stack equivalent).
- Enums live in `DATABASE.md` — code references names, never raw strings.
- After every schema change: regenerate types (<<DB_TYPES_FILE>>), update `DATABASE.md`, append `CHANGELOG.md` entry, update `STATE.md`.
